  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Preview Center**\n\nI\'m now focused on the interactive Preview and Launch Center. The goal is a seamless, live-edit experience for Munachi. I\'m prioritizing user input for her details, color selection, image uploads, and a final confirmation step before export. I want her to build her masterpiece!\n\n\n**Defining Default Data**\n\nI\'ve moved on to defining default settings in `/src/data.ts`. I\'m meticulously matching the copy, adhering strictly to the guidelines: no emojis, no em dashes. I\'ve translated all problematic elements, ensuring clean hyphens or separators. I\'m focusing on \"Orji Munachi - Portfolio Website,\" the tagline, subheadline, supporting lines, and the CTA button text and destination. Key stats in the Hero are currently in process.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will create the `/src/data.ts` file to store the initial data (copywriting body, stats, services, skill pillars, default settings, tool list) compiled directly from the brief. This keeps our content declarative, highly modular, and editable."
