        lines {
          text: "    headline: \"A car dealership that finally looked the part online.\","
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    body: \"Opara Motors came to me with a social media presence that didn\'t reflect the quality of what they were selling. In one month, I took over their content - scripting, shooting direction, editing, and posting - and built a consistent visual identity around their inventory.\\n\\nThe result: 8,405 views, 6,722 people reached, and 1,000 new followers. In 30 days. For a car dealership that previously had next to no traction online.\\n\\nWhen your product costs what a car costs, your content needs to match that value. That was the brief. That was the result.\","
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
