  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Successful Build**\n\nI\'ve got a successful compilation; the build went perfectly! I\'m now reviewing the project files: `types.ts` looks good, and I\'m happy with `data.ts`. The SVG icons in `components/Logos.tsx` have reactive color swapping, and `components/Navigation.tsx` handles scroll behavior correctly.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have designed and built a highly polished, responsive, and interactive **Editorial Brutalist** portfolio website for **Orji Munachi**. \n\nBy utilizing solid design guidelines, I compiled his copy deck, created scale-independent SVG brand icons, and built a custom pre-launch customization dashboard.\n\n### \360\237\214\237 What I Built (Structure & Features)\n\nUnder `/src/components/`, I built a suite of high-fidelity, type-safe modules:\n\n1. **Sticky Navigation (`Navigation.tsx`)**\n   - Implements persistent navigation with responsive mobile menu support.\n   - Leverages custom offset brutalist shadows and includes a clear, accessible `\"Hire Me\"` primary CTA button.\n   - Smoothly scrolls browser focus directly to corresponding layout elements.\n\n2. **Section 1: Hero (`Hero.tsx`)**\n   - Features Orji\'s strong `\"The only social media hire you need.\"` display typography.\n   - Houses three high-impact stats cards (**10,000+ Views**, **3 Industries**, **3 Clients**) styled with black borders and hover translations.\n   - Uses an abstract SVG wireframe backdrop and animations via `motion/react`.\n\n3. **Section 2: About Me (`About.tsx`)**\n   - Transcribes Orji\'s strong, confident first-person biography (fully formatted, including final bold tagline).\n   - Pairs text with a visual column: defaults to an **elegant, geometric portrait card** displaying his initials `\"OM\"`, which instantly updates to load a real headshot whenever a photo URL is provided.\n\n4. **Section 3: Services Grid (`Services.tsx`)**\n   - Showcases Orji\'s six core skill suites (Strategy, Content, Copywriting, Paid Ads, Analytics, Community) arranged in a responsive grid.\n   - Features animated card lifts (`brutalist-shadow-hover`) and strict adherence to the **\"no pricing values\"** mandate.\n\n5. **Section 4: Skills & Tools (`SkillsTools.tsx`)**\n   - Declares the four critical performance pillars (Creative, Strategy, Advertising, Analytics).\n   - Houses a categorizable software suite showing **genuine, monochrome SVG vector brand logos** (Canva, CapCut, Meta, TikTok, Google Ads, Buffer, and Hootsuite) that light up in their official brand colors on cursor hover.\n\n6. **Section 5: Case Study Showcases (`CaseStudies.tsx`)**\n   - Renders deep-dive summaries for **Opara Motors**, **Omereugu Farms**, and **Zext Ventures**.\n   - Showcases delivered services, bold headings, and a structured, high-intensity **2x2 metrics grid** for each client.\n\n7. **Section 6: Client Reviews (`Testimonials.tsx`)**\n   - Arranges testimonials side-by-side with oversized visual quotation accents.\n   - Implements **clear visual placeholder blocks** when quotes are pending, keeping the design clean and motivating before the site is live.\n\n8. **Section 7: Let\'s Work CTA (`Contact.tsx`)**\n   - Anchors the page with a final, high-impact block centering the `\"Hire Me\"` action.\n   - Directs clicks cleanly to open user email programs to `orjimunachi5@gmail.com` without contact form friction.\n\n9. **Brutalist Footer (`Footer.tsx`)**\n   - Displays clean labels, active contact mailto parameters, and direct social profile anchors for Instagram and LinkedIn.\n\n10. **Munachi\'s Launch Center (`LaunchCenter.tsx`)**\n    - A floating drawer tool aiding Orji\'s final handoff adjustments.\n    - **Checklist Tab**: Displays a reactive checklist directly from the guidelines to track progress.\n    - **Branding Palette Tab**: Features a real-time **Accent Color Picker** (updating Terracotta `#a33800` code-wide instantly) and customizable profile mail keys.\n    - **Bio & Links Tab**: Lets Munachi paste personal photo URLs or adjust footers seamlessly.\n    - **Reviews Tab**: Provides direct form slots to quickly insert client quotes.\n    - Uses local storage synchronization so any live edits a user tests are preserved on browser refresh.\n"
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 917917511
    }
