    modified_response: "I have completed the refactoring of Orji Munachi\'s portfolio, successfully transitioning its layout and theme from a brutalist aesthetic into a sleek, high-end, and ultra-modern **Bento Grid** theme:\n\n### **Design Transformation Highlights**\n- **Cosmic Dark Canvas**: Transformed the global theme color palette in the stylesheet down to deep off-blacks and obsidian dark frames with subtle, razor-thin gray borders instead of heavy black outlines.\n- **Glassmorphic Grid Compartments**: Restructured individual cells\342\200\224including the industry case studies and testimonials blocks\342\200\224into discrete cards housing glowing icon containers, pristine typography, and neat padding variations.  \n- **Minimalist Contact & Navigation Controls**: Converted CTA actions into sharp, borderless high-contrast white active buttons with expansive micro-interactions.\n- **Launch Monitor Refinement**: Aligned the floating control drawer and its interactive components (progress checklist, hex accent preset blocks, input forms) into a matching dark bento control panel.\n\nEverything compiles successfully and is ready to deliver an optimized conversion rate for target physical businesses!"
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
